Subject: [PATCH] Revert "drm/amd/display: Add missing kdoc for ALLM
 parameters"
References: bsc#1258210
Patch-mainline: 6.18.42
Git-commit: 958624d6386036d966805def6250972947201817

This reverts commit 038a0f01dda595dceda8f0c9c5172b1297281929.

Signed-off-by: Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
Signed-off-by: Robert Frohl <rfrohl@suse.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/modules/info_packet/info_packet.c | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/modules/info_packet/info_packet.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/modules/info_packet/info_packet.c
index ae858a43c35f..b3d55cac3569 100644
